					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13271569#post-4718956</guid>
				<title>Re: Uncontained: An SCP Card Game</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13271569/uncontained:an-scp-card-game#post-4718956</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2020 09:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Kenoma</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3279539</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hello! I just wanted to announce that we're brewing something again for this game!</p> <p>In the meantime, I'm looking for SCP cards ideas that we can add to the game. What scp cards should we add to the game?</p> <p>Any scp cards would do, it's just an idea after all!</p> <p>Here's some scp cards that as a start:</p> <ul> <li>SCP-3166</li> <li>SCP-939</li> <li>Operation Pizzicato</li> <li>Dr. Wondertainment.</li> </ul> <p>If you have any questions or have scp cards ideas you don't want to post here, feel free to reach me out on <span class="wiki-email">moc.liamg|evitcaretni.deniatnocnu#moc.liamg|evitcaretni.deniatnocnu</span> :)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13271569#post-4676812</guid>
				<title>Re: Uncontained: An SCP Card Game</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13271569/uncontained:an-scp-card-game#post-4676812</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2020 01:41:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Kenoma</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3279539</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I just wanted to announce that if your one of the authors of the SCPs we've included in <a href="https://kenoma.itch.io/scp-card-game">Uncontained</a> as scp cards, you can send me an email on <span class="wiki-email">moc.liamg|evitcaretni.deniatnocnu#moc.liamg|evitcaretni.deniatnocnu</span> and I'll give you a download key for free to gain access to all current expansions and scp cards, and anything that will be added to the game in the future through Itch.io. Just include your Wikidot username in your message and it's good. :)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
