					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13271569#post-4616069</guid>
				<title>scp card game</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13271569/uncontained:an-scp-card-game#post-4616069</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2020 02:16:15 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Kenoma</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3279539</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I just wanted to share a project I and <a href="https://discord.gg/Ff9Exju">others from Discord</a> have been working on for a couple of months now.</p> <p>Here are a few scp cards from the latest version of the game:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;Keter&nbsp;scp&nbsp;cards</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTQyMzE0LzMzMjY3MjQuanBn/347x500/m7z73y.jpg" alt="m7z73y.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;Foundation&nbsp;character&nbsp;cards</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTQyMzE0LzMzMjY3MjguanBn/347x500/XNmPla.jpg" alt="XNmPla.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;more&nbsp;scp&nbsp;cards</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTQyMzE0LzMzMjY3MjcuanBn/347x500/H761zy.jpg" alt="H761zy.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p>Gameplay overview:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;containment&nbsp;of&nbsp;anomaly&nbsp;cards</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTMzNjIucG5n/original/K5ovrf.png" alt="K5ovrf.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;turn&nbsp;phases</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTMzNjkucG5n/original/c%2FBVKN.png" alt="c%2FBVKN.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p>I would just like to gather opinion from the official SCP community since this game is essentially for this community :)</p> <p>You can download the game for free here: <a href="https://kenoma.itch.io/scp-card-game">https://kenoma.itch.io/scp-card-game</a></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
